<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Alerte de sécurité - AgriLink</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#f1f5f1;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;color:#1a1a1a;">
    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color:#f1f5f1;">
        <tr>
            <td align="center" style="padding:40px 16px;">
                <table role="presentation" width="100%" style="max-width:600px;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">

                    <tr>
                        <td style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:28px 40px 20px;text-align:center;border-bottom:3px solid #dc2626;">
                            <img src="{{ app.request is defined ? app.request.schemeAndHttpHost : 'http://localhost' }}/logo_with_text.png" alt="AgriLink" style="height:56px;width:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;" />
                        </td>
                    </tr>

                    <tr>
                        <td style="background-color:#991b1b;padding:24px 40px;text-align:center;">
                            <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center">
                                <tr>
                                    <td style="background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.15);border-radius:50%;width:52px;height:52px;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;">
                                        <svg width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="#ffffff" viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;margin-top:12px;">
                                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-2.5L13.732 4c-.77-.833-1.964-.833-2.732 0L4.072 16.5c-.77.833.192 2.5 1.732 2.5z"/>
                                        </svg>
                                    </td>
                                    <td style="padding-left:14px;text-align:left;">
                                        <p style="margin:0;color:#ffffff;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;">Alerte de sécurité</p>
                                        <p style="margin:4px 0 0;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);font-size:13px;">Tentatives de connexion suspectes détectées</p>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                            </table>
                        </td>
                    </tr>

                    <tr>
                        <td style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:36px 40px;">
                            <p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:15px;color:#374151;">Bonjour <strong>{{ user.nom ?? user.email }}</strong>,</p>
                            <p style="margin:0 0 24px;font-size:15px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;">
                                Nous avons détecté <strong>{{ attempts }} tentative(s) de connexion échouée(s)</strong> sur votre compte AgriLink.
                                {% if accountLocked %}Votre compte a été temporairement verrouillé pour votre sécurité.{% endif %}
                            </p>

                            <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin-bottom:24px;">
                                <tr>
                                    <td style="background-color:#fef2f2;border:1px solid #fecaca;border-radius:12px;padding:20px;">
                                        <p style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#991b1b;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;">Détails de l'activité</p>
                                        <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
                                            <tr>
                                                <td style="padding:6px 0;font-size:14px;color:#6b7280;width:40%;">Adresse IP</td>
                                                <td style="padding:6px 0;font-size:14px;color:#1f2937;font-weight:600;">{{ ipAddress ?? 'Inconnue' }}</td>
                                            </tr>
                                            <tr>
                                                <td style="padding:6px 0;font-size:14px;color:#6b7280;">Date et heure</td>
                                                <td style="padding:6px 0;font-size:14px;color:#1f2937;font-weight:600;">{{ timestamp|date('d/m/Y H:i:s') }}</td>
                                            </tr>
                                            <tr>
                                                <td style="padding:6px 0;font-size:14px;color:#6b7280;">Navigateur</td>
                                                <td style="padding:6px 0;font-size:14px;color:#1f2937;font-weight:600;word-break:break-all;">{{ userAgent|length > 80 ? userAgent|slice(0, 80) ~ '...' : userAgent }}</td>
                                            </tr>
                                            <tr>
                                                <td style="padding:6px 0;font-size:14px;color:#6b7280;">Tentatives</td>
                                                <td style="padding:6px 0;font-size:14px;color:#dc2626;font-weight:700;">{{ attempts }}/5</td>
                                            </tr>
                                        </table>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                            </table>

                            <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin-bottom:24px;">
                                <tr>
                                    <td style="background-color:#fef9c3;border-left:4px solid #eab308;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px 18px;">
                                        <p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;color:#78350f;line-height:1.6;">
                                            <strong>Que faire ?</strong><br>
                                            - Si c'est vous, ignorez ce message.<br>
                                            - Si ce n'est pas vous, changez immédiatement votre mot de passe.<br>
                                            - Activez la double authentification (2FA) pour plus de sécurité.
                                        </p>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                            </table>
                        </td>
                    </tr>

                    <tr>
                        <td style="background-color:#f9fafb;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:20px 40px;text-align:center;">
                            <p style="margin:0 0 4px;font-size:12px;color:#6b7280;">Cet email a été envoyé automatiquement par AgriLink.</p>
                            <p style="margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#9ca3af;">Si vous n'avez pas effectué ces tentatives, sécurisez votre compte immédiatement.</p>
                            <p style="margin:12px 0 0;font-size:11px;color:#d1d5db;">&copy; {{ "now"|date("Y") }} AgriLink</p>
                        </td>
                    </tr>

                </table>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>
</body>
</html>
